  "doc": "Colour theme of each skin and chroma for Fiddlesticks' effects and ability icons (the base effects are red: they are turned to `hue`). match = skin:<League skin number> (its chromas inherit it) or chroma:<word in the chroma's client name>, alternatives split by | (Spanish and English client names) (checked first, so a ruby chroma is red whatever its skin). hue = degrees the base red becomes (-1 = keep the hue); sat / val = multipliers. A skin's own particle textures replace the base ones when League has them under the same name (prep --skin).",
